{"type":"message","id":"07e630f0","parentId":"596d2b8d","timestamp":"2026-03-22T13:36:53.040Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 结论：现在一共 5 个 agent，配置是通的。\n\n1. agent 列表\n- main｜主机器人\n- xixi｜兮兮\n- ling｜玲玲\n- aoao｜熬熬\n- weiwei｜薇薇\n\n2. workspace / agentDir\n- main\n  - workspace: `/root/.openclaw/workspace`\n  - agentDir: `/root/.openclaw/agents/main/agent`\n- xixi\n  - workspace: `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi`\n  - agentDir: `/root/.openclaw/agents/xixi/agent`\n- ling\n  - workspace: `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-lingling`\n  - agentDir: `/root/.openclaw/agents/ling/agent`\n- aoao\n  - workspace: `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-ao`\n  - agentDir: `/root/.openclaw/agents/aoao/agent`\n- weiwei\n  - workspace: `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-wei`\n  - agentDir: `/root/.openclaw/agents/weiwei/agent`\n\n3. 绑定关系 bindings\n- main → Feishu `accountId=default`\n- xixi → Feishu `accountId=xixi`\n- ling → Feishu `accountId=ling`\n- aoao → Feishu `accountId=aoao`\n- weiwei → Feishu `accountId=weiwei`\n- weiwei 还额外绑定了一个群：\n  - `peer.kind=group`\n  - `peer.id=oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009`\n\n4. Feishu 账号配置\n- default → botName: 主机器人\n- xixi → botName: 兮兮\n- ling → botName: 玲玲\n- aoao → botName: 熬熬\n- weiwei → botName: 薇薇\n\n5. 全局 agent 默认配置\n- 主模型：`hgapi/gpt-5.4`\n- fallback：\n  - `openai-codex/gpt-5.4`\n  - `arkcode/deepseek-v3.2`\n- heartbeat 模型：`arkcode/deepseek-v3.2`\n- 默认 workspace：`/root/.openclaw/workspace`\n- maxConcurrent：4\n- subagents.maxConcurrent：8\n\n6. agent-to-agent\n- 已开启\n- allow 列表：\n  - main\n  - xixi\n  - ling\n  - aoao\n  - weiwei\n\n补一句实话：\n当前 `/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json` 里明文放了很多敏感信息，包括：\n- appSecret\n- API key\n- gateway token\n\n这个配置能跑，但安全性很差。建议下一步把这些都迁到环境变量或 secret 管理里，别继续明文裸奔。\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以直接帮你做两件事里的任意一个：\n1. 输出一份“当前所有 agent 配置总览文档”\n2. 进一步检查“每个 agent 是否真的联通、能否互相发消息”","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_052e0ef4890f418e0169bff0680d448191ba4f5521db678f75\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":3080,"output":712,"cacheRead":22144,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25936,"cost":{"input":0.0077,"output":0.01068,"cacheRead":0.005536,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.023916}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774186599108}}
