{"type":"message","id":"5177fc21","parentId":"f8f9647d","timestamp":"2026-03-22T13:45:06.981Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_s5YW3PpdlbZCLTLSGbMHC2cz|fc_052e0ef4890f418e0169bff25dc214819195773851b91ddfee","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/人人都会OpenClaw/03-Bug候选池.md","content":"# Bug 候选池\n\n| ID | 标题 | 模块 | 分类 | 来源 | 优先级 | 状态 | 负责人 | 备注 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| CAND-001 | 待补充 | gateway | 待定 | 主动测试 | P1 | 候选 | xixi | 首轮重点模块 |\n| CAND-002 | 待补充 | sessions | 待定 | 主动测试 | P1 | 候选 | xixi | 首轮重点模块 |\n| CAND-003 | 待补充 | subagents | 待定 | 主动测试 | P1 | 候选 | xixi | 首轮重点模块 |\n| CAND-004 | 待补充 | message | 待定 | 主动测试 | P1 | 候选 | xixi | Feishu / message tool |\n| CAND-005 | 待补充 | docs | docs | docs walkthrough | P1 | 候选 | xixi | 文档与实际一致性 |\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/人人都会OpenClaw/03-Bug候选池.md\",\"content\":\"# Bug 候选池\\n\\n| ID | 标题 | 模块 | 分类 | 来源 | 优先级 | 状态 | 负责人 | 备注 |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| CAND-001 | 待补充 | gateway | 待定 | 主动测试 | P1 | 候选 | xixi | 首轮重点模块 |\\n| CAND-002 | 待补充 | sessions | 待定 | 主动测试 | P1 | 候选 | xixi | 首轮重点模块 |\\n| CAND-003 | 待补充 | subagents | 待定 | 主动测试 | P1 | 候选 | xixi | 首轮重点模块 |\\n| CAND-004 | 待补充 | message | 待定 | 主动测试 | P1 | 候选 | xixi | Feishu / message tool |\\n| CAND-005 | 待补充 | docs | docs | docs walkthrough | P1 | 候选 | xixi | 文档与实际一致性 |\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":222,"output":284,"cacheRead":39424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39930,"cost":{"input":0.000555,"output":0.00426,"cacheRead":0.009856,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.014671}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774187098354}}
