sage` tool 走 Feishu 直发成功，已复现 1/1  \\n3. `feishu_app_scopes` 可正常返回 57 项授权，已复现 1/1  \\n4. `gateway` 可用，但 `openclaw status` 暴露多项 critical 安全配置，已复现 1/1  \\n原因：回传内容已发出，但 agent 间会话发送接口仍超时，无法确认 main 是否收到。  \\n建议：如要避免继续卡在回传链路，可以让我下一条直接把完整候选池正文贴给你，或改走 `message` 直发指定对象/群。\",\n              \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0cc067ee97d726120169bff2ccdd0081919ec992f2bc57f2d4\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\",\n          \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n          \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774187211169\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:aoao:feishu:group:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n      \"kind\": \"group\",\n      \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"displayName\": \"feishu:g-oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"chat:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n        \"accountId\": \"aoao\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1774186727147,\n      \"sessionId\": \"609ed7e6-4d0b-4ad4-a675-5b8708d163e8\",\n      \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 16340,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"lastTo\": \"chat:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n      \"lastAccountId\": \"aoao\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/aoao/sessions/609ed7e6-4d0b-4ad4-a675-5b8708d163e8.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"user\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506: 在吗\\n\\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\\\"...\\\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\\n[System: If user_id is \\\"ou_9eaa2171