ude mention tags in the form <at user_id=\\\"...\\\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\\n[System: If user_id is \\\"ou_ad42dfd596f8218ae2bc6ff9c8951ae1\\\", that mention refers to you.]\\n\\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: 敖敖. Do not write @xxx yourself.]\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"timestamp\": 1774186708492,\n          \"senderLabel\": \"ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \" 在。\",\n              \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0f9d34a2c5be19ad0169bff0d5a7788191a1c37757c42e5cec\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\",\n          \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n          \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774186708501\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:cron:morning-briefing\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"unknown\",\n      \"label\": \"Cron: 每日早报 + InStreet 学习汇报\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Cron: 每日早报 + InStreet 学习汇报\",\n      \"updatedAt\": 1774146615431,\n      \"sessionId\": \"0fa19db8-006d-4d23-9332-0848cd46b062\",\n      \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 272000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 23629,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/0fa19db8-006d-4d23-9332-0848cd46b062.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"thinking\",\n              \"thinking\": \"**Evaluating cron task output**\\n\\nOkay, it’s a challenge because the cron task result is in plain text and needs a concise summary without any fabrication. I should mention the inability to access certain sources due to restrictions. Maybe I can isolate verified information, like the current time and day from the prompt. I’m considering if InStreet is accessible. I might use session_status for the current time, but I'm not sure if it's necessary. I’ll aim for a clear conclusion and identify missing information, providing actionable next steps.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"晨报未完整生成：天气 / 日历 / 待办数据源当前不可用，InStreet 社区热门讨论也未能获取到可验证的公开内容。\\n\\n时间：2026-03-22（周日）10:30\\n\\n**已核实**\\n- briefing 技能要求依赖 3 个来源：Calendar、Todos、Weather。\\n- 当前可用技能中未发现 briefing 依赖的 Calendar / Todos / openmeteo 对应技能。\\n- 已尝试访问 InStreet 公开站点与检索社区入口，但未拿到可验证的热门讨论正文；现有结果不足以支撑可靠汇报。\\n\\n**结论**\\n- 今天这份“完整晨报”不能硬编。\\n- 目前只能确认：数据源缺失，不适合输出伪完整总结。\\n\\n**建议处理**\\n1. 补齐日历 / 待办 / 天气的数据接入后，再跑每日早报。\\n2. 若 InStreet 社区需要稳定纳入晨报，建议提供可直接访问的社区 URL 或登录态可用入口。\",\n              \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0540c1f852eda2520169bf54953e6481919f6b0fd015cbc3a8\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\",\n          \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n          \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774146701264\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:weiwei:feishu:group:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009\",\n      \"kind\": \"group\",\n      \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"displayName\": \"feishu:g-oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"chat:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009\",\n        \"accountId\": \"weiwei\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1774100706734,\n      \"sessionId\": \"8d0e7012-2e0d-412e-8da1-a54a967658de\",\n      \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 272000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 107373,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"lastTo\": \"chat:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009\",\n      \"lastAccountId\": \"weiwei\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/weiwei/sessions/8d0e7012-2e0d-412e-8da1-a54a967658de.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"thinking\",\n              \"thinking\": \"\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"已完成。\\n\\n我这边已经产出 **5 张图**，并按 **方案 3** 交给 **main** 统一回传了。  \\n这 5 张图都用了：\\n- **doubao-seedream-4-5**\\n- **自动裁掉底部水印区域**\\n- **不含“小红书”字样**\",\n              \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_04df422acd63fe200169bea0e11c148191a957438464ef8949\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\",\n          \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n          \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774100700687\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:weiwei:feishu:default:direct:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"unknown\",\n      \"displayName\": \"feishu:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009\",\n      \"updatedAt\": 1774098487704,\n      \"sessionId\": \"dbfceaeb-1ef2-40e6-9fa4-19944cf6b10a\",\n      \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/weiwei/sessions/dbfceaeb-1ef2-40e6-9fa4-19944cf6b10a.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"xiaohongshu-canghe-top3-45-v4.png\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"openai-responses\",\n          \"provider\": \"openclaw\",\n          \"model\": \"delivery-mirror\",\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774098487710\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n  