":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Evaluating cron task output**\n\nOkay, it’s a challenge because the cron task result is in plain text and needs a concise summary without any fabrication. I should mention the inability to access certain sources due to restrictions. Maybe I can isolate verified information, like the current time and day from the prompt. I’m considering if InStreet is accessible. I might use session_status for the current time, but I'm not sure if it's necessary. I’ll aim for a clear conclusion and identify missing information, providing actionable next steps."},{"type":"text","text":"晨报未完整生成：天气 / 日历 / 待办数据源当前不可用，InStreet 社区热门讨论也未能获取到可验证的公开内容。\n\n时间：2026-03-22（周日）10:30\n\n**已核实**\n- briefing 技能要求依赖 3 个来源：Calendar、Todos、Weather。\n- 当前可用技能中未发现 briefing 依赖的 Calendar / Todos / openmeteo 对应技能。\n- 已尝试访问 InStreet 公开站点与检索社区入口，但未拿到可验证的热门讨论正文；现有结果不足以支撑可靠汇报。\n\n**结论**\n- 今天这份“完整晨报”不能硬编。\n- 目前只能确认：数据源缺失，不适合输出伪完整总结。\n\n**建议处理**\n1. 补齐日历 / 待办 / 天气的数据接入后，再跑每日早报。\n2. 若 InStreet 社区需要稳定纳入晨报，建议提供可直接访问的社区 URL 或登录态可用入口。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0540c1f852eda2520169bf54953e6481919f6b0fd015cbc3a8\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774146701264}]},{"key":"agent:weiwei:feishu:group:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009","kind":"group","channel":"feishu","displayName":"feishu:g-oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu","to":"chat:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009","accountId":"weiwei"},"updatedAt":1774100706734,"sessionId":"8d0e7012-2e0d-412e-8da1-a54a967658de","model":"gpt-5.4","contextTokens":272000,"totalTokens":107373,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"chat:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009","lastAccountId":"weiwei","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/weiwei/sessions/8d0e7012-2e0d-412e-8da1-a54a967658de.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","