s+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/cli/message.md\"\n          },\n          \"partialJson\": \"{\\\"file_path\\\":\\\"/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/5/.pnpm/openclaw@2026.3.11_@napi-rs+canvas@0.1.97_@types+express@5.0.6_node-llama-cpp@3.16.2/node_modules/openclaw/docs/cli/message.md\\\"}\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\",\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"toolUse\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1774187145065\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"toolResult\",\n      \"toolCallId\": \"call_FkEwJCbktf7y1EXhhnvGyXCF|fc_0cc067ee97d726120169bff28d61d88191b0c223052ccb7aae\",\n      \"toolName\": \"read\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"---\\nsummary: \\\"CLI reference for `openclaw message` (send + channel actions)\\\"\\nread_when:\\n  - Adding or modifying message CLI actions\\n  - Changing outbound channel behavior\\ntitle: \\\"message\\\"\\n---\\n\\n# `openclaw message`\\n\\nSingle outbound command for sending messages and channel actions\\n(Discord/Google Chat/Slack/Mattermost (plugin)/Telegram/WhatsApp/Signal/iMessage/MS Teams).\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```\\nopenclaw message <subcommand> [flags]\\n```\\n\\nChannel selection:\\n\\n- `--channel` required if more than one channel is configured.\\n- If exactly one channel is configured, it becomes the default.\\n- Values: `whatsapp|telegram|discord|googlechat|slack|mattermost|signal|imessage|msteams` (Mattermost requires plugin)\\n\\nTarget formats (`--target`):\\n\\n- WhatsApp: E.164 or group JID\\n- Telegram: chat id or `@username`\\n- Discord: `channel:<id>` or `user:<id>` (or `<@id>` mention; raw numeric ids are treated as channels)\\n- Google Chat: `spaces/<spaceId>` or `users/<userId>`\\n- Slack: `channel:<id>` or `user:<id>` (raw channel id is accepted)\\n- Mattermost (plugin): `channel:<id>`, `user:<id>`, or `@username` (bare ids are treated as channels)\\n- Signal: `+E.164`, `group:<id>`, `signal:+E.164`, `signal:group:<id>`, or `username:<name>`/`u:<name>`\\n- iMessage: handle, `chat_id:<id>`, `chat_guid:<guid>`, or `chat_identifier:<id>`\\n- MS Teams: conversation id (`19:...@thread.tacv2`) or `conversation:<id>` or `user:<aad-object-id>`\\n\\nName lookup:\\n\\n- For supported providers (Discord/Slack/etc), channel names like `Help` or `#help` are resolved via the directory cache.\\n- On cache miss, OpenClaw will attempt a live directory lookup when the provider supports it.\\n\\n## Common flags\\n\\n- `--channel <name>`\\n- `--account <id>`\\n- `--target <dest>` (target channel or user for send/poll/read/etc)\\n- `--targets <name>` (repeat; broadcast only)\\n- `--json`\\n- `--dry-run`\\n- `--verbose`\\n\\n## Actions\\n\\n### Core\\n\\n- `send`\\n  - Channels: WhatsApp/Telegram/Discord/Google Chat/Slack/Mattermost (plugin)/Signal/iMessage/MS Teams\\n  - Required: `--target`, plus `--message` or `--media`\\n  - Optional: `--media`, `--reply-to`, `--thread-id`, `--gif-playback`\\n  - Telegram only: `--buttons` (requires `channels.telegram.capabilities.inlineButtons` to allow it)\\n  - Telegram only: `--thread-id` (forum topic id)\\n  - Slack only: `--thread-id` (thread timestamp; `--reply-to` uses the same field)\\n  - WhatsApp only: `--gif-playback`\\n\\n- `poll`\\n  - Channels: WhatsApp/Telegram/Discord/Matrix/MS Teams\\n  - Required: `--target`, `--poll-question`, `--poll-option` (repeat)\\n  - Optional: `--poll-multi`\\n  - Discord only: `--poll-duration-hours`, `--silent`, `--message`\\n  - Telegram only: `--poll-duration-seconds` (5-600), `--silent`, `--poll-anonymous` / `--poll-public`, `--thread-id`\\n\\n- `react`\\n  - Channels: Discord/Google Chat/Slack/Telegram/WhatsApp/Signal\\n  - Required: `--message-id`, `--target`\\n  - Optional: `--emoji`, `--remove`, `--participant`, `--from-me`, `--target-author`, `--target-author-uuid`\\n  - Note: `--remove` requires `--emoji` (omit `--emoji` to clear own reactions where supported; see /tools/reactions)\\n  - WhatsApp only: `--participant`, `--from-me`\\n  - Signal group reactions: `--target-author` or `--target-author-uuid` required\\n\\n- `reactions`\\n  - Channels: Discord/Google Chat/Slack\\n  - Required: `--message-id`, `--target`\\n  - Optional: `--limit`\\n\\n- `read`\\n  - Channels: Discord/Slack\\n  - Required: `--target`\\n  - Optional: `--limit`, `--before`, `--after`\\n  - Discord only: `--around`\\n\\n- `edit`\\n  - Channels: Discord/Slack\\n  - Required: `--message-id`, `--message`, `--target`\\n\\n- `delete`\\n  - Channels: Discord/Slack/Telegram\\n  - Required: `--message-id`, `--target`\\n\\n- `pin` / `unpin`\\n  - Channels: Discord/Slack\\n  - Required: `--message-id`, `--target`\\n\\n- `pins` (list)\\n  - Channels: Discord/Slack\\n  - Required: `--target`\\n\\n- `permissions`\\n  - Channels: Discord\\n  - Required: `--target`\\n\\n- `search`\\n  - Channels: Discord\\n  - Required: `--guild-id`, `--query`\\n  - Optional: `--channel-id`, `--channel-ids` (repeat), `--au\\n…(truncated)…\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"isError\": false,\n      \"timestamp\": 1774187151072\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"toolCall\",\n          \"id\": \"call_ecuLbrEd8KeUGdsVTGxGHOZT|fc_0cc067ee97d726120169bff29030b48191a33328f2ef9fd456\",\n          \"name\": \"message\",\n          \"arguments\": {\n            \"action\": \"send\",\n            \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n            \"target\": \"ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24\",\n            \"message\": \"xixi 自测：message tool / Feishu 直发链路检查。可忽略。\",\n            \"silent\": true,\n            \"bestEffort\": true\n          },\n          \"partialJson\": \"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"send\\\",\\\"channel\\\":\\\"feishu\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24\\\",\\\"message\\\":\\\"xixi 自测：message tool / Feishu 直发链路检查。可忽略。\\\",\\\"silent\\\":true,\\\"bestEffort\\\":true}\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\",\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"toolUse\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1774187151076\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"xixi 自测：message tool / Feishu 直发链路检查。可忽略。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"openai-responses\",\n      \"provider\": \"openclaw\",\n      \"model\": \"delivery-mirror\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1774187154406\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"toolResult\",\n      \"toolCallId\": \"call_ecuLbrEd8KeUGdsVTGxGHOZT|fc_0cc067ee97d726120169bff29030b48191a33328f2ef9fd456\",\n      \"toolName\": \"message\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"{\\n  \\\"channel\\\": \\\"feishu\\\",\\n  \\\"to\\\": \\\"ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24\\\",\\n  \\\"via\\\": \\\"direct\\\",\\n  \\\"mediaUrl\\\": null,\\n  \\\"result\\\": {\\n    \\\"channel\\\": \\\"feishu\\\",\\n    \\\"messageId\\\": \\\"om_x100b54cb67ef60a0b10236b94b3eee6\\\",\\n    \\\"chatId\\\": \\\"ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24\\\"\\n  }\\n}\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"isError\": false,\n      \"timestamp\": 1774187154407\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"toolCall\",\n          \"id\": \"call_ipqEtd1hXaxdR57DhLVYKELB|fc_0cc067ee97d726120169bff2939c508191939de6db58f783d8\",\n          \"name\": \"sessions_send\",\n          \"arguments\": {\n            \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n            \"timeoutSeconds\": 20,\n            \"message\": \"状态：成功\\n任务：建设“人人都会OpenClaw”项目首轮候选问题/测试切入点池（gateway、sessions/subagents、Feishu/message tool、docs walkthrough）\\n结果：\\n一、gateway 模块候选\\n1）来源：本机直接执行 `openclaw gateway status --json` 与 `openclaw status`\\n环境：Linux 6.8.0-71-generic；Node 22.22.1；OpenClaw app 2026.3.11；gateway 端口 34459；bind=lan\\n前置条件：gateway systemd 服务已安装并运行\\n复现步骤：\\n- 执行 `openclaw gateway status --json`\\n- 观察 service/config/gateway/rpc 字段\\n- 执行 `openclaw status`\\n- 对照安全审计输出\\n预期结果：gateway 可达；状态与 RPC 一致；若存在高风险配置，应被审计直接报出\\n实际结果：已复现成功。gateway status 显示 rpc.ok=true、service running；openclaw status 同时报出多项高风险项，包括 host-header origin fallback、禁用 device auth、Feishu open groupPolicy 等。\\n复现频率：本轮 1/1\\n\\n二、sessions/subagents 模块候选\\n1）来源：当前 agent 协作上下文 + 直接调用 sessions_send 回传 main\\n环境：Feishu 多 agent 协作；sessionKey=agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\\n前置条件：main 与 xixi 会话均存在；gateway 正常运行\\n复现步骤：\\n- 用 sessions_send 向 main direct session 发送固定文本\\n- 设置 timeoutSeconds=20\\n- 观察返回状态\\n预期结果：应返回成功或至少可确认投递结果\\n实际结果：已复现成功一个候选问题：多次调用 sessions_send 均返回 timeout，无法确认是否送达。这不是脑补，是已发生现象。\\n复现频率：已复现 3/3（本会话内连续三次 timeout）\\n2）来源：任务要求中的 subagents 重点，但当前未实际启动 subagent\\n环境：当前 xixi 会话\\n前置条件：需要明确一个可执行的 subagent 任务\\n复现步骤：未执行\\n预期结果：待补\\n实际结果：未复现成功。当前只拿到 sessions_send 超时线索，尚未做 subagent 最小复现。\\n复现频率：0/0\\n\\n三、Feishu/message tool 模块候选\\n1）来源：直接调用 feishu_app_scopes\\n环境：Feishu 插件已加载\\n前置条件：Feishu 已完成配置\\n复现步骤：\\n- 调用 feishu_app_scopes\\n- 检查 granted scopes\\n预期结果：能读到当前租户已授权能力，用于判断 message/群聊操作可行性\\n实际结果：已复现成功。返回 57 granted、0 pending，可确认 im:message、im:chat.members:read、im:message:update 等能力已授权。\\n复现频率：1/1\\n2）来源：直接调用 message tool 向 xixi 自己的 Feishu direct 发消息\\n环境：channel=feishu；target=ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24\\n前置条件：message tool 可用；Feishu 账号在线\\n复现步骤：\\n- 调用 `message action=send channel=feishu target=<xixi direct id> message=\\\"xixi 自测：message tool / Feishu 直发链路检查。可忽略。\\\"`\\n- 观察返回 messageId/chatId\\n预期结果：返回发送成功并带 messageId\\n实际结果：已复现成功。返回 messageId=om_x100b54cb67ef60a0b10236b94b3eee6，chatId 正常。\\n复现频率：1/1\\n3）来源：Feishu 与 sessions_send 路径对比\\n环境：同上\\n前置条件：message 与 sessions_send 都可调用\\n复现步骤：\\n- 同一轮任务里分别尝试 message 直发与 sessions_send 回传 main\\n- 对比结果\\n预期结果：两条链路都稳定\\n实际结果：已复现成功一个对比现象：message 直发成功；sessions_send 回传 main 连续 timeout，说明问题更像是 agent 间会话回执链路，而不是 Feishu 基础发信故障。\\n复现频率：message 1/1 成功；sessions_send 3/3 timeout\\n\\n四、docs walkthrough 模块候选\\n1）来源：本地 docs 文件直接读取\\n环境：本地文档目录 `/root/.local/share/pnpm/global/.../openclaw/docs`\\n前置条件：本地 docs 存在\\n复现步骤：\\n- 读取 `docs/zh-CN/index.md`\\n- 读取 `docs/cli/gateway.md`、`docs/cli/agents.md`、`docs/cli/skills.md`、`docs/cli/message.md`\\n- 核对是否能支撑新手 walkthrough 主线\\n预期结果：能拼出“安装/网关/多 Agent/消息工具”最小学习路径\\n实际结果：已复现成功。当前 docs 足够支撑首轮 walkthrough 主线，但 docs 对 message CLI 的渠道示例偏通用，Feishu 专项教学仍需项目侧补案例；另外 sessions/subagents 的“排障型 walkthrough”需要补真实故障样例，目前已知样例是 sessions_send timeout。\\n复现频率：1/1\\n\\n建议整理成首轮候选池优先级：\\nP1：sessions_send 对 main 连续 timeout\\nP1：gateway 虽可用但安全配置存在多项 critical，适合作为“部署后第一件事检查什么”的 walkthrough\\nP1：message tool 在 Feishu 直发成功，可作为正向最小闭环示例\\nP2：Feishu scopes 校验流程，可作为排障前置步骤\\nP2：docs walkthrough 先围绕 gateway→agents→message→安全审计 串一版\\nP3：subagents 单独补一个最小任务后再建故障池，当前未复现成功\\n原因：\\n- 我优先做了可直接落地的最小复现，不做空泛建议。\\n- 当前项目目录还没有现成案例文档，所以候选池先基于真实环境、真实命令、真实工具回包来建。\\n- sessions/subagents 中，现阶段真正已复现的是 sessions_send timeout；subagent 本体还没启动，所以明确标注“未复现成功”。\\n建议：\\n- 让 main 先把这 4 条纳入首批案例池。\\n- 下一步可派 ling/weiwei 分别做：① sessions_send timeout 复核；② subagent 最小任务跑通；③ Feishu/message 正反向链路验证；④ docs walkthrough 草稿落文档。\\n- 如果需要，我下一轮可以继续把以上候选池整理成标准表格或 issue 模板。\"\n          },\n          \"partialJson\": \"{\\\"sessionKey\\\":\\\"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\\\",\\\"timeoutSeconds\\\":20,\\\"message\\\":\\\"状态：成功\\\\n任务：建设“人人都会OpenClaw”项目首轮候选问题/测试切入点池（gateway、sessions/subagents、Feishu/message tool、docs walkthrough）\\\\n结果：\\\\n一、gateway 模块候选\\\\n1）来源：本机直接执行 `openclaw gateway status --json` 与 `openclaw status`\\\\n环境：Linux 6.8.0-71-generic；Node 22.22.1；OpenClaw app 2026.3.11；gateway 端口 34459；bind=lan\\\\n前置条件：gateway systemd 服务已安装并运行\\\\n复现步骤：\\\\n- 执行 `openclaw gateway status --json`\\\\n- 观察 service/config/gateway/rpc 字段\\\\n- 执行 `openclaw status`\\\\n- 对照安全审计输出\\\\n预期结果：gateway 可达；状态与 RPC 一致；若存在高风险配置，应被审计直接报