 \"rpc\": {\n    \"ok\": true,\n    \"url\": \"ws://127.0.0.1:34459\"\n  },\n  \"extraServices\": []\n}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774187121993},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bhrnYJuZ0wFeQk0jMiXMKMWb|fc_0cc067ee97d726120169bff27763348191b81a4eff7c2c1708","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw status","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi","yieldMs":15000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"openclaw status\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi\",\"yieldMs\":15000}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774187121998},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_bhrnYJuZ0wFeQk0jMiXMKMWb|fc_0cc067ee97d726120169bff27763348191b81a4eff7c2c1708","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[plugins] plugins.allow is empty; discovered non-bundled plugins may auto-load: adp-openclaw (/root/.openclaw/extensions/adp-openclaw/index.ts), ddingtalk (/root/.openclaw/extensions/ddingtalk/index.ts), openclaw-plugin-yuanbao (/root/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-plugin-yuanbao/dist/index.js), openclaw-qqbot (/root/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-qqbot/index.ts), pinchtab (/root/.openclaw/extensions/pinchtab/index.ts), wecom (/root/.openclaw/extensions/wecom/index.ts). Set plugins.allow to explicit trusted ids.\n[plugins] feishu_doc: Registered feishu_doc, feishu_app_scopes\n[plugins] feishu_chat: Registered feishu_chat tool\n[plugins] feishu_wiki: Registered feishu_wiki tool\n[plugins] feishu_drive: Registered feishu_drive tool\n[plugins] feishu_bitable: Registered bitable tools\n[adp-openclaw] register() called - starting plugin registration\n[plugins] [adp-openclaw] Plugin register() called\n[adp-openclaw] Registering tool factory: adp_upload_file\n[plugins] [adp-openclaw] Registering tool factory: adp_upload_file\n[adp-openclaw] Tool adp_upload_file registered successfully\n[plugins] [adp-openclaw] Tool adp_upload_file registered successfully\n[adp-openclaw] Plugin registration complete\n[plugins] [adp-openclaw] Plugin registration complete\nOpenClaw status\n\nOverview\n┌─────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Item            │ Value                                                                                              │\n├─────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Dashboard       │ http://10.3.0.12:34459/afpkti/                                                                     │\n│ OS              │ linux 6.8.0-71-generic (x64) · node 22.22.1                                                        │\n│ Tailscale       │ off                                                                                                │\n│ Channel         │ stable (default)                                                                                   │\n│ Update          │ available · pnpm · npm update 2026.3.13                                                            │\n│ Gateway         │ local · ws://127.0.0.1:34459 (local loopback) · reachable 25ms · auth token · VM-0-12-ubuntu (10.  │\n│                 │ 3.0.12) app 2026.3.11 linux 6.8.0-71-generic                                                       │\n│ Gateway service │ systemd installed · enabled · running (pid 3035442, state active)                                  │\n│ Node service    │ systemd not installed                                                                              │\n│ Agents          │ 5 · no bootstrap files · sessions 25 · default main active 1m ago                                  │\n│ Memory          │ 0 files · 0 chunks · dirty · sources memory · plugin memory-core · vector unknown · fts ready ·    │\n│                 │ cache on (0)                                                                                       │\n│ Probes          │ skipped (use -