t:ling:feishu:ling:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"webchat\",\n      \"displayName\": \"webchat:g-agent-ling-feishu-ling-direct-ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"webchat\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1774065725916,\n      \"sessionId\": \"cef80983-8de9-495b-9aae-54f7ab3b18f1\",\n      \"model\": \"Pro/zai-org/GLM-5\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 40210,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"webchat\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/root/.openclaw/agents/ling/sessions/cef80983-8de9-495b-9aae-54f7ab3b18f1.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"thinking\",\n              \"thinking\": \"发送仍然超时。我应该让用户确认是否收到了结果，或者尝试其他方式传达结果。我可以直接在当前会话回复用户。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \" 已完成10个 skills 信息查询，发送到 weiwei 会话超时。以下是结果：\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10个 ClawHub Skills 简介（小红书封面用）\\n\\n| # | Skill | 一句话描述 |\\n|---|-------|-----------|\\n| 1 | **self-improving-agent** | 持续学习进化：自动记录错误和教训，让AI越用越聪明 |\\n| 2 | **find-skills** | 技能发现器：帮你搜索和安装适合的AI技能包 |\\n| 3 | **summarize** | 智能摘要器：快速总结网页、PDF、YouTube视频内容 |\\n| 4 | **agent-browser** | 浏览器自动化：让AI操控浏览器，点击、填表、截图全搞定 |\\n| 5 | **skill-vetter** | 技能安检员：安装前扫描代码，识别安全风险 |\\n| 6 | **gog** | Google套件工具：一键操作Gmail、日历、Drive、联系人 |\\n| 7 | **github** | GitHub增强：用gh CLI管理PR、Issues、工作流状态 |\\n| 8 | **ontology** | 知识图谱引擎：用实体和关系管理复杂项目的知识网络 |\\n| 9 | **proactive-agent** | 主动型AI：不等指令就干活，自动记忆、自我进化 |\\n| 10 | **weather** | 天气查询：免费无API，一行命令获取全球天气 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n**小红书封面建议：**\\n- 主标题：「10个让AI开挂的ClawHub技能」\\n- 可用图标+名称+4字标签呈现每项\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n          \"provider\": \"siliconflow\",\n          \"model\": \"Pro/zai-org/GLM-5\",\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1774065713324\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"count":15,"sessions":[{"key":"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-feishu-default-direct-ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu","to":"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","accountId":"default"},"updatedAt":1774190192879,"sessionId":"1e241059-521f-41c6-bf00-680c450c09c1","model":"gpt-5.4","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":54136,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","lastAccountId":"default","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/1e241059-521f-41c6-bf00-680c450c09c1.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":" 收到，继续。\n\n最新状态我直接给结论：\n\n- **hgapi/gpt-5.4 已经实际跑通**\n- xixi 那边在 **Gateway 重启后已成功用这个模型产出回复**\n- 说明现在不是“只写进配置了”，而是**真实调用已经通了**\n\n目前唯一还不稳定的老问题，还是之前那条：\n- **`sessions_send` 回执链路偶发 timeout**\n- 但这不影响 `hgapi/gpt-5.4` 本身可用\n\n### 现在可以认定的事\n1. 新 provider `hgapi` 已接入成功  \n2. `hgapi/gpt-5.4` 已经是主模型  \n3. 模型真实调用成功  \n4. 老的 timeout 更像是 **session 回执问题**，不是模型问题\n\n### 我建议下一步\n要么继续干活  \n要么我顺手把这个结论沉淀成一条正式记录，避免后面又反复确认：\n\n- `hgapi/gpt-5.4`：**可用，已实测**\n- `sessions_send timeout`：**独立问题，和模型切换无关**\n\n如果你现在要继续推进别的事，直接发任务。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01bb7c6add707f1f0169bffe69b07881918b6a19d64e5cbefe\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774190183496}]},{"key":"agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-xixi-feishu-xixi-direct-ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774190182268,"sessionId":"187d71cf-e471-4f44-a050-29007b4aaffb","model":"gpt-5.4","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":35653,"abor