能。\n- 已尝试访问 InStreet 公开站点与检索社区入口，但未拿到可验证的热门讨论正文；现有结果不足以支撑可靠汇报。\n\n**结论**\n- 今天这份“完整晨报”不能硬编。\n- 目前只能确认：数据源缺失，不适合输出伪完整总结。\n\n**建议处理**\n1. 补齐日历 / 待办 / 天气的数据接入后，再跑每日早报。\n2. 若 InStreet 社区需要稳定纳入晨报，建议提供可直接访问的社区 URL 或登录态可用入口。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0540c1f852eda2520169bf54953e6481919f6b0fd015cbc3a8\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774146701264}]},{"key":"agent:weiwei:feishu:group:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009","kind":"group","channel":"feishu","displayName":"feishu:g-oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu","to":"chat:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009","accountId":"weiwei"},"updatedAt":1774100706734,"sessionId":"8d0e7012-2e0d-412e-8da1-a54a967658de","model":"gpt-5.4","contextTokens":272000,"totalTokens":107373,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"chat:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009","lastAccountId":"weiwei","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/weiwei/sessions/8d0e7012-2e0d-412e-8da1-a54a967658de.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":""},{"type":"text","text":"已完成。\n\n我这边已经产出 **5 张图**，并按 **方案 3** 交给 **main** 统一回传了。  \n这 5 张图都用了：\n- **doubao-seedream-4-5**\n- **自动裁掉底部水印区域**\n- **不含“小红书”字样**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04df422acd63fe200169bea0e11c148191a957438464ef8949\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774100700687}]},{"key":"agent:weiwei:feishu:default:direct:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","displayName":"feishu:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009","updatedAt":1774098487704,"sessionId":"dbfceaeb-1ef2-40e6-9fa4-19944cf6b10a","model":"gpt-5.4","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/weiwei/sessions/dbfceaeb-1ef2-40e6-9fa4-19944cf6b10a.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistan